WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.380
- We can't get enough of Ross Matthews.

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:07.010
And I wanted to introduce
him to our amazing VFFs.

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:08.360
Ross, say hello.
- Hi everybody.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.040
Hi, oh cute!

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.010
- Who's got a question,

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:15.103
Pamela?
- I do.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.880
- Hi, Pamela.
- Hi cute.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.016
- [Drew] What's your question?

00:00:20.016 --> 00:00:23.630
- Hi Drew, well, I wanted to know,

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:26.940
like I do rage breaking and stress baking.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.480
So I wanted to know what
your favorite thing is

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.730
to eat when you're stressed out?

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:34.220
- Cheesecake, for sure cheesecake.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:38.520
Does it ever like end up
looking like this on you?

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:41.930
- Not once, it will get
on my shirt and my shoes,

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:43.790
but not all over my face.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:45.810
And I don't want my kids
to see this episode,

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:50.230
because they might get
a hint that that's okay.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.270
- Well, I've been known to
be a bad influence before,

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.170
but this seems like relatively healthy.

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:58.290
- Ross, what do you eat
when you're stressed?

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:00.577
- Wine.
(audience laughs)

00:01:00.577 --> 00:01:01.410
- Yes, exactly.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:05.410
Well, before we go, in
honor National Sandwich Day

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:07.880
at our friend Jersey Mike's are giving

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:11.460
our VFFs a free sub from Jersey Mike's.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:13.240
And I'm sure watching this segment,

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.940
they're gonna be like, who
decided to say yes to this?

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:19.600
Why did this allowed to be here?

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.580
- Can I tell you how obsessed
I am with Jersey Mike's too?

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:23.560
Everybody, my favorite is a number 16,

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.130
which is like a chicken
Philly cheese steak sandwich.

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:28.688
Try it, trust me, ooh, thank you.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:30.740
- I have to say, I am the
biggest Jersey Mike's fan

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:32.960
and I really love a beautiful sandwich.

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:35.300
It's one of life's great pleasures.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.110
And happy National Sandwich Day.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.770
And I just think that I'm very grateful.

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:42.510
You know, when we work with companies,

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:45.100
it really means a lot to me,
I take it very seriously.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.550
And we work with this
wonderful man Brandon,

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:49.770
and we love doing
trade-offs and integrations,

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:53.440
because I like talking about
companies who provide people

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:55.650
with stuff that's in their life.

00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:58.040
And I'm always really
honored to work with them.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:01:59.550
So thank you, Jersey Mike's.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:00.510
- Yeah, thank you, Jersey Mike's.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:01.410
So what kind you got there?

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:02.243
- Oh, you know what?

00:02:02.243 --> 00:02:06.300
I found a little turkey
and what do you have?

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.420
- I think I have an Italian

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:08.730
sort of roast beef situation here,

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.870
I'm not complaining about it.

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:11.460
- Well, let's do it.

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:13.632
We get to eat so much fun stuff

00:02:13.632 --> 00:02:14.563
on the show, it's such a treasure.

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:18.200
- Okay, Jersey Mike's.
- Oh, it's so good.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.230
- Thank you.
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:21.463
- We've can't both chew.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:23.233
- It's so good.

00:02:23.233 --> 00:02:26.540
Everybody, please enjoy your day.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:28.770
Be safe, be good to each other.

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:31.910
Rage bake, watch TV, vote.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:34.140
Be good to yourselves and each other.

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:35.870
Have some fun, have some laughs,

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:38.300
be serious and everything in between.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.520
Thank you for allowing us to come

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.660
into your home and your life.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:45.310
We're very honored to be a part
of it, thank you, good bye.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.483
- [Ross] Yes Drew, well said.

00:02:47.483 --> 00:02:50.066
(upbeat music)

